Water and wastewater operator-emergency
HB0022
response.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Campbell, E and Senator(s) Crago
AN ACT relating to homeland security; amending a definition to include certified
water and wastewater operators for purposes of emergency response; requiring
local homeland security plans to coordinate with certified water and wastewater
operators as specified; and providing for an effective date.
